        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Entry Function Lever for Global Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Entry Function Lever (key locks and unlocks lever) for use with <a href=\"/products/exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-al\"><b>Global ED-501-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/dark-bronze-exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-du\"><b>Global ED-501-DU</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-al\"><b>Global ED-VR531-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/dark-bronze-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-du\"><b>Global ED-VR531-DU</b></a>,  \r\n<a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\"><b>Global ED-501ALARM-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-alarm-exit-device-global-ed-vr531alarm-al\"><b>Global ED-VR531ALARM-AL</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWill fit a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole. Removable studs so it works with doors prepared with and with out commercial thru-bolt holes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global ED-LHL500 Keyed Entry Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Entry - Key locks and unlocks the lever. When unlocked turning the lever unlatches the exit device. </li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b> or <b>Dark Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preps</li>\r\n<li>Standard Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant Door Hardware</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Entry Lever for Exit Device, Global ED-LHL500",
                "description": "Global ED-LHL500 - This is a Entry Function Lever (key locks and unlocks lever) for Global ED-501-AL,  Global ED-501-DU, Global ED-VR531-AL, Global ED-VR531-DU,  Global ED-VR531ALARM-AL, Global ED-501ALARM-AL  Exit Devices. Packaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys. Available in Brushed Chrome or Dark Bronze finish.",
